<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were weak to $0.50 lower. Demand light for a moderate run. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  55.00-56.50, few 57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  54.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows: Unevenly steady. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 42.00-44.00, few 44.50</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00, few 46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 44.00-47.50, mostly 46.00-47.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 47.00-50.00, mostly 48.00</p>
</text>
